<p>You don’t have to know what you believe before you come, and you don’t have to stay if it isn’t for you.</p>
<p>Plan to arrive a few minutes early to find a seat. All are welcome here at The Table, and we hope you feel comfortable joining us.</p>
<h2 id="when">When</h2>
<p>Sundays at 5pm. We also stream on <a href="https://www.facebook.com/TheTableTX/">Facebook</a> and <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4C3HWTMx34ec7QJ5hkhtwg">YouTube</a>.</p>
<h2 id="where-we-meet">Where</h2>
<p>First United Methodist Church of Sachse<br>
1520 Blackburn Rd<br>
Sachse, TX 75048</p>
<p>Parking is available directly in front of the church building.</p>
